      "snippet": "Hey HN, I’m Vishnu from Agent37 (<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;agent37.com\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;agent37.com</a>). We build sandboxes for running AI agents at under 10% of the cost of most sandbox providers. Our customers spend an average of $0.37&#x2F;month per sandbox.<p>You can view a video walkthrough of the product here: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;youtu.be&#x2F;DK5ISR2tbNo\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;youtu.be&#x2F;DK5ISR2tbNo</a><p>We started as one of those OpenClaw wrapper companies back in February (yup.. judge me). In time we added more and more harnesses.<p>One of the goals I had at the time was to offer a free plan to users, so as to gain more market share. But it was too cost prohibitive to do it right away. Especially since we were bootstrapped and servers were running on my savings.<p>Today we’re actually able to offer the free plan thanks to the optimizations we’ve made si",
